      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree d848c3753207e256e0ace9890dcc27d3cadd2baf\nparent aef8a04966d7ab6c04edc5d19b733e78205405de\nauthor Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1790716616 +0200\ncommitter Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1791324288 +0200\n\ntest: check the wtxid in p2p_blocksonly's block-relay-only inv assertion\n\nThe connection that checks a transaction submitted over RPC is not\nannounced to a block-relay-only peer uses P2PTxInvStore, which negotiates\nwtxidrelay. The node would therefore announce the transaction by its\nwtxid, and the assertion looked for the txid, which cannot be in the\nstore for a transaction carrying a witness: it passed whether or not the\ntransaction was announced.\n\nAssert on the wtxid instead. With the connection opened as\noutbound-full-relay rather than block-relay-only, the old assertion still\npasses and the new one fails.\n",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEEsRUSBAxuhte14D3RTXHtOpqO38UFAmrFcIAbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEE1x7Tqajt/FPoAP+gNn5918nNsSmGfzqpmS\nBqsQQstty7wc35cN7uu9mm26SuExGn9FgQi8xp41hDlrQU8biQqlsvqaaYtZOJ6P\ndZuLuT19bay16iC5aokt4W03r0P2E4b7jDiPNC2tMf4jk7IW5JFuZ9onoY7PCkX5\nYgsBNSKXNA2XuNSbq2pY6UTo1+QTZbyi94AiY+aMfOFsQRrojpLBA4uDUOfKrUeT\na6hPOke/aUPvUT3jiDXxNVRkTBz1IRncYTdBLuG1iUwZ+NGwt/RcpkX1Ak15FtsF\nEr/VETy8AxXcfkvIji3r6ul1QJV3MX++zI+EMfmnAid4n8Q7J4Vxg/qobXY3vVZs\nejlUFxiYX7hYltMDGdu89XYMcxSEiQ5vQS/0LxXUZavucLZoHufZY7oRKr8/6RrP\nsn8xSSO0DY/dmrzbuUQA68kL0F31qiRPvGqY9rcy1EuaJkiqUL+7pNENZKfB+ZbD\nnIcaNz20MDe+b9Q51xO7rf4PMYftxklqp+9Og+WKoRZHidlfGkuFAQltz+1liYFb\ndMHeqbZegvvv9WYGmzLTo4Cagt58abZ8jmfsyeONvaMzFrCHJCk6GxrW4AOlwvyH\njHBJg8+Mu1bgQ+oRmAVXwJFX2VFQMnNcVmDGT/YxLFwpXyPVxSgapG4xUYbPw9qt\npGXl0ZycHO+b3xr7TE53iKPb\n=V1Ic\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----"
