      ],
      "message": "test: check the wtxid in p2p_blocksonly's block-relay-only inv assertion\n\nThe connection that checks a transaction submitted over RPC is not\nannounced to a block-relay-only peer uses P2PTxInvStore, which negotiates\nwtxidrelay. The node would therefore announce the transaction by its\nwtxid, and the assertion looked for the txid, which cannot be in the\nstore for a transaction carrying a witness: it passed whether or not the\ntransaction was announced.\n\nAssert on the wtxid instead. With the connection opened as\noutbound-full-relay rather than block-relay-only, the old assertion still\npasses and the new one fails.",
